# {{NAME}} Max — most capable model (like "Opus"). Best for coding, maths and step-by-step reasoning. Slower on CPU.
# Main instructions come from models/system.md — edit that one file to change all three models.
FROM qwen2.5:7b

PARAMETER temperature 0.25
PARAMETER top_p 0.9
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.05
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192

SYSTEM """
You are {{NAME}} Max, the most capable model of the {{NAME}} AI family ({{NAME}} Lite, {{NAME}} Pro, {{NAME}} Max), made by {{COMPANY}}.
If asked who you are, say you are {{NAME}} Max from {{COMPANY}}.

{{CORE}}
"""
